
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="Explore free puzzles and games on Toolnes, including word search, Sudoku, crosswords and 2048.">
  <title>Puzzles &amp; Games | Toolnes</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f5f7fb;
      color: #172033;
    }

    header {
      background: white;
      padding: 18px 20px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    }

    .header-inner {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: auto;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 26px;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #2563eb;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    nav {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    nav a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #334155;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    main {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 40px 20px 60px;
    }

    .hero {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 35px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(30px, 5vw, 44px);
      margin: 0 0 12px;
    }

    .hero p {
      color: #64748b;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .games-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 22px;
    }

    .game-card {
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 24px;
      min-width: 0;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 18px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05);
    }

    .game-icon {
      font-size: 36px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .game-card h2 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      font-size: 21px;
    }

    .game-card p {
      color: #64748b;
      line-height: 1.6;
      flex: 1;
    }

    .game-button {
      display: block;
      padding: 12px;
      text-align: center;
      border-radius: 9px;
      background: #2563eb;
      color: white;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .game-button:hover {
      background: #1d4ed8;
    }

    .coming-soon {
      display: block;
      padding: 12px;
      text-align: center;
      border-radius: 9px;
      background: #eef2f7;
      color: #64748b;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .featured {
      border: 2px solid #2563eb;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      background: white;
      padding: 24px;
      color: #64748b;
      border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    }

    @media (max-width: 800px) {
      .games-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 540px) {
      .games-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <header>
    <div class="header-inner">
      <a class="logo" href="/">Toolnes</a>
      <nav>
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <a href="/text-tools/">Text Tools</a>
        <a href="/calculators/">Calculators</a>
        <a href="/puzzles/">Puzzles</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <h1>Puzzles &amp; Games</h1>
      <p>Discover free puzzles, challenge your brain and enjoy fun games on Toolnes.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="games-grid">

      <article class="game-card">
        <div class="game-icon">🔎</div>
        <h2>Word Search</h2>
        <p>Create and print your own word search puzzles.</p>
        <a class="game-button" href="/puzzles/word-search/">Create Word Search</a>
      </article>

      <article class="game-card">
        <div class="game-icon">📝</div>
        <h2>Crossword Generator</h2>
        <p>Create crossword puzzles for learning and entertainment.</p>
        <span class="coming-soon">Coming Soon</span>
      </article>

      <article class="game-card">
        <div class="game-icon">🔢</div>
        <h2>Sudoku Generator</h2>
        <p>Challenge your logic with number puzzles.</p>
        <span class="coming-soon">Coming Soon</span>
      </article>

      <article class="game-card">
        <div class="game-icon">🌀</div>
        <h2>Maze Generator</h2>
        <p>Generate mazes to solve and print.</p>
        <span class="coming-soon">Coming Soon</span>
      </article>

      <article class="game-card">
        <div class="game-icon">🔤</div>
        <h2>Word Scramble</h2>
        <p>Unscramble letters and test your vocabulary.</p>
        <span class="coming-soon">Coming Soon</span>
      </article>

      <article class="game-card">
        <div class="game-icon">🎯</div>
        <h2>Bingo Generator</h2>
        <p>Create bingo cards for parties and classrooms.</p>
        <span class="coming-soon">Coming Soon</span>
      </article>

      <article class="game-card featured">
        <div class="game-icon">🧩</div>
        <h2>2048 Game</h2>
        <p>Merge matching number tiles and try to reach 2048.</p>
        <a class="game-button" href="/puzzles/2048/">Play 2048</a>
      </article>

    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 Toolnes — Free online tools and games.</p>
    <a href="/">Back to Home</a>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
